---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="God of War Ragnarök — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="God of War Ragnarök buying guide: editions, upgrade path, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>God of War Ragnarök — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>God of War Ragnarök</strong> closes the Norse saga for Kratos and Atreus,
      delivering a bigger, more varied action-adventure than its 2018 predecessor and a
      perennial best-seller on PS5.
    </p>

    <h2>Editions explained</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full campaign</li>
      <li><strong>Digital Deluxe</strong> — adds behind-the-scenes video and cosmetic sets; skip unless you want the extras</li>
      <li><strong>Collector's Edition</strong> — physical statue and trinkets for collectors only</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Digital vs physical on PS5</h2>
    <p>
      Ragnarök is a game you'll keep installed for a long time, so digital is convenient.
      It dips during major PlayStation sales, and PSN digital codes on key stores like
      Green Man Gaming frequently undercut the PlayStation Store. Compare before buying.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=god+of+war+ragnarok+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=God+of+War+Ragnarok+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
